<title>GERMANY: Fresenius Q1 pre-tax profit up 120 pct.</title>
<headline>Fresenius Q1 pre-tax profit up 120 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31 (in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   51	vs 20</p>
<p>    Group sales				  1,635   vs 600</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     88	vs 40</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German medical products group is Fresenius AG. The group said that the sharp rise in results was largely driven by strong results at its majority owned unit Fresenius Medical Care and through acquisitions.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
